ewRequirement\042\072false\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042O piso\054 a parede\054 o teto e a porta devem possuir revestimento liso\054 de cor clara\054 imperme\134u00e1vel e lav\134u00e1vel\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\0424\0567\0562 Anexo I  \057 Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07255\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0722\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0562\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1331\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042A porta deve ser equipada com dispositivo de fechamento autom\134u00e1tico\054 ajustada aos batentes e em adequado estado de conserva\134u00e7\134u00e3o\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\0424\0567\0562 Anexo I  \057 Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07255\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0723\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0562\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1331\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042Na \134u00e1rea de envase\054 somente devem permanecer as embalagens ou recipientes necess\134u00e1rios para uso imediato\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\042\134u00a7 1\134u00ba Art\056 48 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07255\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0724\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0562\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\133\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072true\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042A ventila\134u00e7\134u00e3o deve ser capaz de manter o ambiente livre de condensa\134u00e7\134u00e3o de vapor d\047\047\134u00e1gua e n\134u00e3o pode constituir fonte de contamina\134u00e7\134u00e3o\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\042\134u00a7 2\134u00ba Art\056 48 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07255\054\042sourcePhra