ewRequirement\042\072false\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042O piso\054 a parede\054 o teto e a porta devem possuir revestimento liso\054 de cor clara\054 imperme\134u00e1vel e lav\134u00e1vel\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\0424\0567\0562 Anexo I  \057 Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07255\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0722\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0562\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1331\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042A porta deve ser equipada com dispositivo de fechamento autom\134u00e1tico\054 ajustada aos batentes e em adequado estado de conserva\134u00e7\134u00e3o\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\0424\0567\0562 Anexo I  \057 Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07255\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0723\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0562\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1331\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042Na \134u00e1rea de envase\054 somente devem permanecer as embalagens ou recipientes necess\134u00e1rios para uso imediato\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\042\134u00a7 1\134u00ba Art\056 48 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07255\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0724\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0562\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\133\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072true\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042A ventila\134u00e7\134u00e3o deve ser capaz de manter o ambiente livre de condensa\134u00e7\134u00e3o de vapor d\047\047\134u00e1gua e n\134u00e3o pode constituir fonte de contamina\134u00e7\134u00e3o\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\042\134u00a7 2\134u00ba Art\056 48 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07255\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0725\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0562\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\133\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072true\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042Os aparelhos de ar condicionado devem estar em boas condi\134u00e7\134u00f5es de conserva\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 limpeza e higiene\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\042Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07255\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0726\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0562\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\133\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072true\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042Devem existir registros da limpeza e desinfec\134u00e7\134u00e3o di\134u00e1ria dos filtros e superf\134u00edcies dos aparelhos de ar condicionado\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\042Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07255\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0727\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0562\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\133\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072true\175\135\054\04256\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042Na sala de envase devem ser adotadas medidas para minimizar o risco de contamina\134u00e7\134u00e3o\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PCC\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\0424\0567\0564 Anexo I  \057 Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07256\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0564\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042A sala de envase deve possuir piso com inclina\134u00e7\134u00e3o suficiente para facilitar o escoamento de \134u00e1gua\054 ralo sifonado com tampa escamote\134u00e1vel\054 lumin\134u00e1rias protegidas contra quebras e ventila\134u00e7\134u00e3o capaz de manter o ambiente livre de condensa\134u00e7\134u00e3o de vapor d\134u2019\134u00e1gua\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\0424\0567\0564 Anexo I  \057 Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07256\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0722\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0564\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1331\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\135\054\04257\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042O acesso \134u00e0 sala de envase deve ser restrito e realizado exclusivamente por uma antessala\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0722\054\042ref\042\072\0424\0567\0565 Anexo I  \057 Art\056 50 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07257\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0565\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042A antessala deve possuir arm\134u00e1rio exclusivo para armazenamento dos equipamentos de prote\134u00e7\134u00e3o individual e lavat\134u00f3rio com torneira acionada sem contato manual\054 exclusivo para higiene das m\134u00e3os\054 dotado de sabonete l\134u00edquido inodoro\054 produto antiss\134u00e9ptico e sistema de secagem das m\134u00e3os acionado sem contato manual\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PCC\042\054\042P\042\0722\054\042ref\042\072\0424\0567\0565 Anexo I  \057 PU Art\056 50 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07257\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0722\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0565\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1331\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\135\054\04258\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042Os funcion\134u00e1rios que trabalham na sala de envase devem utilizar uniformes limpos\054 que devem ser trocados diariamente e serem de uso exclusivo para essa \134u00e1rea\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042P\042\0722\054\042ref\042\072\0424\0567\0566 Anexo I  \057 Art\056 51 CP 1365\05725 \057 Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07258\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0566\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\135\054\04259\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042A sala de envase e os equipamentos devem ser higienizados quantas vezes forem necess\134u00e1rias e imediatamente ap\134u00f3s o t\134u00e9rmino do trabalho\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0723\054\042ref\042\072\0424\0567\0568 Anexo I  \057 Art\056 52 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07259\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0568\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042Quando aplic\134u00e1vel\054 a higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o deve contemplar o desmonte dos equipamentos na frequ\134u00eancia definida pelo estabelecimento industrial\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0723\054\042ref\042\072\0424\0567\0568 Anexo I  \057 PU Art\056 52 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07259\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0722\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0568\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1331\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\135\054\04260\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042A sala de envase deve ser bem ventilada e dispor de sistema de press\134u00e3o positiva eficaz com ar micrometricamente filtrado\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PCC\042\054\042P\042\0721\054\042ref\042\072\042Art 37 Res\056 193\05724 ANM\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PCC\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07260\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072null\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\133\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072true\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042Os sistemas de ventila\134u00e7\134u00e3o mec\134u00e2nica devem estar em boas condi\134u00e7\134u00f5es de conserva\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 limpeza e higiene\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042P\042\072