8 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07262\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0562\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042O piso\054 a parede\054 o teto e a porta devem possuir revestimento liso\054 de cor clara\054 imperme\134u00e1vel e lav\134u00e1vel\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\0424\0567\0562 Anexo I  \057 Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07262\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0722\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0562\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1331\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042A porta deve ser equipada com dispositivo de fechamento autom\134u00e1tico\054 ajustada aos batentes e em adequado estado de conserva\134u00e7\134u00e3o\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\0424\0567\0562 Anexo I  \057 Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07262\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0723\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0562\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1331\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042Na \134u00e1rea de envase\054 somente devem permanecer as embalagens ou recipientes necess\134u00e1rios para uso imediato\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\042\134u00a7 1\134u00ba Art\056 48 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07262\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0724\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0562\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\133\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072true\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042A ventila\134u00e7\134u00e3o deve ser capaz de manter o ambiente livre de condensa\134u00e7\134u00e3o de vapor d\047\047\134u00e1gua e n\134u00e3o pode constituir fonte de contamina\134u00e7\134u00e3o\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\042\134u00a7 2\134u00ba Art\056 48 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07262\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0725\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0562\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\133\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072true\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042Os aparelhos de ar condicionado devem estar em boas condi\134u00e7\134u00f5es de conserva\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 limpeza e higiene\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\042Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07262\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0726\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0562\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\133\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072true\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042Devem existir registros da limpeza e desinfec\134u00e7\134u00e3o di\134u00e1ria dos filtros e superf\134u00edcies dos aparelhos de ar condicionado\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\042Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07262\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0727\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0562\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\133\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072true\175\135\054\04263\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042A adi\134u00e7\134u00e3o de di\134u00f3xido de carbono \134u00e0 \134u00e1gua\054 quando houver\054 deve estar integrada \134u00e0 linha de envase\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0721\054\042ref\042\072\0424\0567\0563 Anexo I  \057 Art\056 49 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PC\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07263\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0563\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\135\054\04264\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042Na sala de envase devem ser adotadas medidas para minimizar o risco de contamina\134u00e7\134u00e3o\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PCC\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\0424\0567\0564 Anexo I  \057 Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07264\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0564\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042A sala de envase deve possuir piso com inclina\134u00e7\134u00e3o suficiente para facilitar o escoamento de \134u00e1gua\054 ralo sifonado com tampa escamote\134u00e1vel\054 lumin\134u00e1rias protegidas contra quebras e ventila\134u00e7\134u00e3o capaz de manter o ambiente livre de condensa\134u00e7\134u00e3o de vapor d\134u2019\134u00e1gua\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\0424\0567\0564 Anexo I  \057 Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07264\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0722\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0564\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1331\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\135\054\04265\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042O acesso \134u00e0 sala de envase deve ser restrito e realizado exclusivamente por uma antessala\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0722\054\042ref\042\072\0424\0567\0565 Anexo I  \057 Art\056 50 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07265\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0565\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042A antessala deve possuir arm\134u00e1rio exclusivo para armazenamento dos equipamentos de prote\134u00e7\134u00e3o individual e lavat\134u00f3rio com torneira acionada sem contato manual\054 exclusivo para higiene das m\134u00e3os\054 dotado de sabonete l\134u00edquido inodoro\054 produto antiss\134u00e9ptico e sistema de secagem das m\134u00e3os acionado sem contato manual\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PCC\042\054\042P\042\0722\054\042ref\042\072\0424\0567\0565 Anexo I  \057 PU Art\056 50 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPR\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07265\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0722\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0565\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1331\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\135\054\04266\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042Os funcion\134u00e1rios que trabalham na sala de envase devem utilizar uniformes limpos\054 que devem ser trocados diariamente e serem de uso exclusivo para essa \134u00e1rea\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042P\042\0722\054\042ref\042\072\0424\0567\0566 Anexo I  \057 Art\056 51 CP 1365\05725 \057 Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07266\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0566\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\135\054\04267\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042A sala de envase e os equipamentos devem ser higienizados quantas vezes forem necess\134u00e1rias e imediatamente ap\134u00f3s o t\134u00e9rmino do trabalho\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0723\054\042ref\042\072\0424\0567\0568 Anexo I  \057 Art\056 52 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07267\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0568\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042Quando aplic\134u00e1vel\054 a higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o deve contemplar o desmonte dos equipamentos na frequ\134u00eancia definida pelo estabelecimento industrial\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0723\054\042ref\042\072\0424\0567\0568 Anexo I  \057 PU Art\056 52 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07267\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0722\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\0567\0568\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1331\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\135\054\04268\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042A sala de envase deve ser bem ventilada e dispor de sistema de press\134u00e3o positiva eficaz com ar micrometricamente filtrado\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PCC\042\054\042P\042\0721\054\042ref\042\072\042Art 37 Res\056 193\05724 ANM\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PCC\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07268\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072null\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\133\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072true\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042Os sistemas de ventila\134u00e7\134u00e3o mec\134u00e2nica devem estar em boas condi\134u00e7\134u00f5es de conserva\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 limpeza e higiene\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042P\042\0721\054\042ref\042\072\042Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07268\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0722\054\042legacyCode\042\072null\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\133\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072true\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042Devem existir registros da troca dos filtros utilizados\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0721\054\042ref\042\072\042Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07268\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0723\054\042legacyCode\042\072null\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\133\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072true\175\135\054\04269\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042O estabelecimento industrial deve implantar e documentar o controle de qualidade da \134u00e1gua captada\054 da \134u00e1gua envasada\054 dos insumos\054 de embalagens e\054 quando utilizado\054 do di\134u00f3xido de carbono\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\0424\05610\0561 Anexo I  \057 Art\056 70 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PC\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07269\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\05610\0561\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\135\054\04270\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042As an\134u00e1lises laboratoriais para o controle e o monitoramento da qualidade \134u00e1gua captada\054 \134u00e1gua mineral\054 e \134u00e1gua devem ser realizadas em laborat\134u00f3rio pr\134u00f3prio ou terceirizado\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\0424\05610\0562 Anexo I  \057 Art\056 71 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PC\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07270\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\05610\0562\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\135\054\04271\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042As an\134u00e1lises microbiol\134u00f3gicas e de composi\134u00e7\134u00e3o qu\134u00edmica da \134u00e1gua envasada devem ser realizadas\054 no m\134u00ednimo\054 a cada lote do produto e atender ao disposto em legisla\134u00e7\134u00e3o espec\134u00edfica\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0725\054\042ref\042\072\0424\05610\0563 Anexo I  \057 \134u00a7 2\134u00ba Art\056 71 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07271\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\05610\0563\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\135\054\04272\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042O estabelecimento deve definir o n\134u00edvel de prote\134u00e7\134u00e3o do seu plano de amostragem\054 de modo que o n\134u00famero de unidades a coletar nas diversas etapas de industrializa\134u00e7\134u00e3o e a frequ\134u00eancia das an\134u00e1lises tenham por base o volume de produ\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 o tamanho dos lotes e o disposto nesta Instru\134u00e7\134u00e3o Normativa\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0724\054\042ref\042\072\0424\05610\0564 Anexo I  \057 \134u00a7 4\134u00ba Art\056 71 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07272\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\05610\0564\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042O plano de amostragem deve possuir seguran\134u00e7a igual ou superior ao definido nesta Instru\134u00e7\134u00e3o Normativa e definir os limites de aceita\134u00e7\134u00e3o a serem determinados nas amostras coletadas\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0725\054\042ref\042\072\042\134u00a7 4\134u00ba Art\056 71 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07272\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0722\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\05610\0564\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1331\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042O estabelecimento deve adotar o plano m\134u00ednimo de amostargem do Art\056 4 da Portaria SUVISA 4325\05725\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0725\054\042ref\042\072\042Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PC\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07272\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0723\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\05610\0564\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\133\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072true\175\135\054\04273\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042A \134u00e1gua mineral natural ou a \134u00e1gua natural envasada deve apresentar composi\134u00e7\134u00e3o equivalente \134u00e0 respectiva \134u00e1gua emergente da fonte ou po\134u00e7o\054 conforme especificada nas an\134u00e1lises laboratoriais efetuadas pelo \134u00f3rg\134u00e3o competente\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0725\054\042ref\042\072\0424\05610\0565 Anexo I  \057 \134u00a7 3\134u00ba Art\056 71 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PC\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07273\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\05610\0565\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\135\054\04274\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042O estabelecimento industrial deve adotar as medidas corretivas em caso de desvios dos par\134u00e2metros estabelecidos\056 Essas medidas devem estar documentadas\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0725\054\042ref\042\072\0424\05610\0566 Anexo I  \057 Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07274\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\05610\0566\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\0541\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\135\054\04275\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042Quando realizada a adi\134u00e7\134u00e3o de di\134u00f3xido de carbono na \134u00e1gua mineral natural\054 na \134u00e1gua natural ou na \134u00e1gua adicionada de sais\054 o g\134u00e1s adquirido deve atender aos requisitos especificados pelo Food Chemical Codex \050FCC\051\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0722\054\042ref\042\072\0424\05612\0566 Anexo I  \057 Art\056 24 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PC\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07275\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\05612\0566\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\135\054\04276\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042Devem ser realizados testes f\134u00edsico\055 qu\134u00edmicos e microbiol\134u00f3gicos para reavalia\134u00e7\134u00e3o da qualidade da \134u00e1gua caso haja qualquer altera\134u00e7\134u00e3o na fonte da \134u00e1gua captada\054 na configura\134u00e7\134u00e3o do sistema ou quando os resultados anal\134u00edticos forem insatisfat\134u00f3rios\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0721\054\042ref\042\072\042Art\056 73 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07276\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072null\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\133\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072true\175\135\054\04277\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042Deve ser feita a Reten\134u00e7\134u00e3o de Amostras dos lotes envasados at\134u00e9 o t\134u00e9rmino davalidade\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0721\054\042ref\042\072\042Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PC\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07277\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072null\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\133\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072true\175\135\054\04278\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042A \134u00e1gua envasada somente pode ser liberada para comercializa\134u00e7\134u00e3o ap\134u00f3s aprova\134u00e7\134u00e3o pelo controle de qualidade\054 por meio dos laudos de an\134u00e1lise\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0721\054\042ref\042\072\042Art\056 74 CP 1365\05725\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PCC\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07278\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072null\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\133\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072true\175\135\054\04279\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042Os manipuladores de alimentos devem ser supervisionados\054 sendo capacitados periodicamente em\072 higiene pessoal\054 manipula\134u00e7\134u00e3o higi\134u00eanica dos alimentos e em doen\134u00e7as transmitidas por alimentos\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042P\042\0722\054\042ref\042\072\0424\05611\0561 Anexo I  \057 Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07279\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\05611\0561\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\135\054\04280\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042A responsabilidade pela industrializa\134u00e7\134u00e3o da \134u00e1gua mineral natural e da \134u00e1gua natural deve ser exercida pelo respons\134u00e1vel t\134u00e9cnico legalmente habilitado no conselho\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0722\054\042ref\042\072\0424\05611\0562 Anexo I  \057 Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PC\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07280\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\05611\0562\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042Estabelecimentos com envase de garraf\134u00f5es retorn\134u00e1veis devem ter o respons\134u00e1vel t\134u00e9cnico legalmente habilitado junto ao CRQ 3\134u00aa Regi\134u00e3o\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0722\054\042ref\042\072\042Lei Est\056 10003\05723\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PC\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07280\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0722\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\05611\0562\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042Estabelecimentos com envase de garraf\134u00f5es retorn\134u00e1veis devem ter no r\134u00f3tulo o respons\134u00e1vel t\134u00e9cnico legalmente habilitado junto ao CRQ 3\134u00aa Regi\134u00e3o\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0722\054\042ref\042\072\042Lei Est\056 10003\05723\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PC\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07280\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0723\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\05611\0562\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\135\054\04281\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042A responsabilidade deve ser exercida por funcion\134u00e1rio que tenha realizado curso de capacita\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 com carga hor\134u00e1ria m\134u00ednima de 40 \050quarenta\051 horas\054 abordando os seguintes temas\072a\051 Microbiologia de Alimentos\073b\051 Industrializa\134u00e7\134u00e3o da \134u00e1gua mineral natural e da \134u00e1gua natural\073c\051 Boas Pr\134u00e1ticas \073d\051 Sistema de An\134u00e1lise de Perigos e Pontos Cr\134u00edticos de Controle \055 APPCC\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0723\054\042ref\042\072\0424\05611\0563 Anexo I  \057 Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PC\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07281\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\05611\0563\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\054\173\042texto\042\072\042A capacita\134u00e7\134u00e3o dos respons\134u00e1veis pela industrializa\134u00e7\134u00e3o dever\134u00e1 ser atualizada a cada dois anos\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPRO\042\054\042P\042\0723\054\042ref\042\072\042Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PC\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07281\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0722\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\05611\0563\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\135\054\04282\042\072\133\173\042texto\042\072\042O estabelecimento industrial deve dispor do certificado de capacita\134u00e7\134u00e3o dos manipuladores e do certificado do respons\134u00e1vel pela industrializa\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 devidamente datado\054 contendo a carga hor\134u00e1ria e o conte\134u00fado program\134u00e1tico dos cursos\056\042\054\042cat\042\072\042PPHO\042\054\042P\042\0723\054\042ref\042\072\0424\05611\0564 Anexo I  \057 Port\056 SUVISA\042\054\042sourceClass\042\072\042PC\042\054\042sourceSerial\042\07282\054\042sourcePhrase\042\0721\054\042legacyCode\042\072\0424\05611\0564\042\054\042legacyIndices\042\072\1330\135\054\042newRequirement\042\072false\175\135\175\054\042prob\042\072\173\0421\042\0723\054\0422\042\0723\054\0423\042\0723\054\0424\042\0722\054\0425\042\0724\054\0426\042\0722\054\0427\042\0723\054\0428\042\0724\054\0429\042\0721\054\04210\042\0724\054\04211\042\0724\054\04212\042\0724\054\04213\042\0723\054\04214\042\0723\054\04215\042\0724\054\04216\042\0723\054\04217\042\0723\054\04218\042\0721\054\04219\042\0721\054\04220\042\0724\054\04221\042\0723\054\04222\042\0725\054\04230\042\0723\054\04231\042\0722\054\04232\042\0723\054\04233\042\0724\054\04234\042\0723\054\04235\042\0722\054\04236\042\0723\054\04237\042\0724\054\04238\042\0724\054\04239\042\0724\054\04240\042\0723\054\04243\042\0723\054\04244\042\0722\054\04245\042\0723\054\04246\042\0722\054\04247\042\0722\054\04248\042\0723\054